meta {
  name: 20 Misroute Detection
  seq: 20
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  A scan at a location that isn't on the route of the item's open shipment is flagged
  (offRouteShipment on the event). GET /Shipments/{id}/route-check and
  GET /Shipments?offRoute=true show shipments that are misrouted now.

  Uses the network from 18 Route Planning. The shipment is auto-routed via Phitsanulok,
  then item A is scanned at Nakhon Sawan (off route), and so is a pallet holding item B.
}
